db-cmd-draw-spline-next = Specify next fit point or [Enter to finish]:
db-cmd-draw-xline-label = Construction line
db-cmd-draw-xline-description = Draws infinite lines through two points, horizontal, vertical, or at an angle through a point.
db-cmd-draw-xline-first = Specify a point or [Hor/Ver/Ang]:
db-cmd-draw-xline-next = Specify through point [Hor/Ver/Ang/Undo], Enter to finish:
